p", "url": "https://otsuma.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/7016/files/OK52021.pdf"}, {"title": "glam.uoregon.edu", "url": "https://glam.uoregon.edu/s/tekagami-kyogire/item/3482"}]}, "The search didn't turn up the poem. None of the results contain 夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき, so I can't confirm its author, its volume and poem number, or its headnote from these results.\n\nThe results that came back were mostly general material:\n- A Kokugakuin Zasshi article on Man'yōshū and Kokinshū expressions of 恋 (love/longing).\n- A Waseda paper on the use of 恋ふ and 恋す in classical waka.\n- A Kadokawa edition of the Shin Kokin Wakashū love poems (下巻, 2007), with a 訳注 by 久保田淳.\n- A page from the Shin Kokin Wakashū manuscript (Univ. of Oregon digital collection) showing a different poem.\n- A Tekagami poem record (glam.uoregon.edu/s/tekagami-kyogire/item/3482) with a related verse about dreams and remembering a lover's face. It is not this poem.\n\nA more targeted search, such as the full poem text in quotation marks together with 新古今 and 和歌データベース or 国文学研究資料館, would likely find the exact entry and its commentary. I can run that search if you'd like."], "durationSeconds": 7.072931959, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MPTrkhG422uivmvdNi5LHK", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
