{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01E1q3KVtRam5h66T39xhwdN", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/tears/page/11/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/iro/page/22/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://glam.uoregon.edu/s/tekagami-kyogire/item/3348\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/namida/page/11/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/tears/page/12/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zh.moegirl.org.cn/%E7%A9%BA%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%B3%AA\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mzh.moegirl.org.cn/%E7%A9%BA%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%B3%AA\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/love-iv-13/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/namida/page/10/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:55:27.663Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"契りしことを忘れずは\" \"涙の色ぞゆかしき\"", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01NG3a5nAKQscmUrSViFYamf", "content": [{"title": "Tag Archives: tears", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/tears/page/11/"}, {"title": "Tag Archives: iro", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/iro/page/22/"}, {"title": "216 A fragment from an unidentified poetry collection; the first poem of the fragment opens with, Okiwakare (おきわかれ)", "url": "https://glam.uoregon.edu/s/tekagami-kyogire/item/3348"}, {"title": "Tag Archives: namida", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/namida/page/11/"}, {"title": "www.wakapoetry.net", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/tears/page/12/"}, {"title": "zh.moegirl.org.cn", "url": "https://zh.moegirl.org.cn/%E7%A9%BA%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%B3%AA"}, {"title": "mzh.moegirl.org.cn", "url": "https://mzh.moegirl.org.cn/%E7%A9%BA%E8%89%B2%E4%B9%8B%E6%B3%AA"}, {"title": "Love IV: 13", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/love-iv-13/"}, {"title": "Tag Archives: namida", "url": "https://www.wakapoetry.net/tag/namida/page/10/"}]}, "I found the poem, but the wording differs slightly from your query. The source gives 夜もすがら契りし事を忘れずば, with 忘れずば (not 忘れずは) and an opening phrase your query leaves out. The closing phrase 涙の色ぞゆかしき is also a little different there: it appears as こひむ涙のいろぞ床しき. 夜もすがら契りし事を忘れずばこひむ涙のいろぞ床しき\n\nThe poem appears on wakapoetry.net, which gives a romanized reading and an English rendering. It is listed as during the reign of former Emperor Ichijō, after Her Majesty, the Empress had passed away, when some letters were found tied with the cord that had been used to hold back her curtain of state. The source says it was among three poems written down when the Emperor wanted to see them. The page does not name the author, so I can't attribute it. It is labeled as Goshūi-shū (GSIS) X:536, a collection reference rather than an author. The same site has the poem indexed under \"Love V\" in its own collection of tagged poems. GSIS X: 536"], "durationSeconds": 8.734903708, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01E1q3KVtRam5h66T39xhwdN", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_014avLupGz5EjbH3oNbr4zwB", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11301980811\"}, {\"url\": \"https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11267871766\"}, {\"url\": \"https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q10131518890\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsjaFk0Z5es\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ameblo.jp/mjt-5933/entry-12851684850.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wakadokoro.com/learn/%E8%BE%9E%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AE%E6%AD%8C-%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%EF%BC%99%E3%80%8C%E5%A4%9C%E3%82%82%E3%81%99%E3%81%8C%E3%82%89%E5%A5%91%E3%82%8A%E3%81%97%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%82%92%E5%BF%98%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9A/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://note.com/fumitaka_imase/n/n86f3c0f9517c\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ameblo.jp/waka-kajima/entry-11978500568.html\"}, {\"url\": \"http://utanari.com/?p=292\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T22:55:28.079Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "よもすがら ちぎりしことを わするなよ 忘れずは 恋ひむ涙の色 ゆかしき 和歌 作者 千載和歌集 OR 後拾遺和歌集 OR 金葉和歌集 OR 詞花和歌集", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_012KugYY8TbgwgXf6cT6Bogi", "content": [{"title": "定子が詠んだ和歌について質問です。「夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき」の - 「忘れずは」の意味が「忘... - Yahoo!知恵袋", "url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11301980811"}, {"title": "至急です。夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしきと言う文が... - Yahoo!知恵袋", "url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11267871766"}, {"title": "無名草子で皇后宮（藤原定子）が死に際に詠んだ歌で夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしきなぜ、死に際にいたっ... - Yahoo!知恵袋", "url": "https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q10131518890"}, {"title": "ずっと真夜中でいいのに。『よもすがら』MV (ZUTOMAYO - yomosugara) - YouTube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsjaFk0Z5es"}, {"title": "夜もすがら契りし事を忘れずは こひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき", "url": "https://ameblo.jp/mjt-5933/entry-12851684850.html"}, {"title": "辞世の句・歌 その９「夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき」（藤原定子） - 令和和歌所", "url": "https://wakadokoro.com/learn/%E8%BE%9E%E4%B8%96%E3%81%AE%E6%AD%8C-%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%EF%BC%99%E3%80%8C%E5%A4%9C%E3%82%82%E3%81%99%E3%81%8C%E3%82%89%E5%A5%91%E3%82%8A%E3%81%97%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%82%92%E5%BF%98%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9A/"}, {"title": "「夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき」(中宮定子が一条天皇に贈った「辞世の歌」)｜linguistics research and writing", "url": "https://note.com/fumitaka_imase/n/n86f3c0f9517c"}, {"title": "藤原定子 夜もすがら", "url": "https://ameblo.jp/waka-kajima/entry-11978500568.html"}, {"title": "utanari » 夜もすがら契りしことを忘れずは恋ひむ涙の色ぞゆかしき || いとうるはしき和歌のデータベース", "url": "http://utanari.com/?p=292"}]}, "この歌の作者は**藤原定子**（一条天皇の中宮）です。複数の解説で確認できました。後拾遺和歌集哀傷536に収められており、千載・金葉・詞花の各集ではなく後拾遺集が出典です。\n\n- **作者**：定子は、死後に見つかった文の中に書き付けられていた三首のうちの一首として、この歌を残したとされています。定子は一条帝の紅涙によって、二人が交わした「永遠無二の愛」を確かめようとしたという解釈も紹介されています。\n- **歌の意味**：一般的な解釈では、一晩中交わした約束を忘れないでいてくれるなら、死後に自分を恋しく思って流す涙の色を見たい、という意味です。「涙の色」は血の涙を指すと解されています。\n- **注意**：検索結果は後拾遺集での収載を示すものばかりで、千載集・金葉集・詞花集への収載は確認できませんでした。"], "durationSeconds": 8.58301275, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_014avLupGz5EjbH3oNbr4zwB", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
